The launch profile (docker-compose.yml, start/stop scripts, .env.example) is from
https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Dual-DGX-Spark-1M-Context at commit
d84319952b41df812603830cd13ae921c39860f7. The repository has no licence file; its README
states the code is provided under the MIT License. The container image is aidendle94's
public vLLM fork build (pinned by digest); its own licences apply. The model weights are
DeepSeek's (MIT).
